    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="48">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:IICn">II Cn</ref> 48</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">Gif hwa forwyrne godcunde gerihte. Gyf hwa godcundra rihta mid wige forwyrne, gylde lahslit mid Denum ⁊ fulwite mid Englum, oððe geladige hine—nime XI men ⁊ beo him seolf twelfta.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">If anyone refuses to render ecclesiastical dues. If anyone resists by force the payment of ecclesiastical dues, he shall pay lahslit in a Danish district, and the full fine in an English one, or he shall clear himself: he shall select 11 men and shall make himself a twelfth.</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">Gif hwa mid wige godcundra gerihta forwyrne, gilde lahslit mid Denum, fullwite mid Englum; oððe geladige hine: nime XI ⁊ beo sylf twelfta.</ab>
      </div>
    </body>
